Die schönsten in Canada.</p>
<pb n="128" facs="#f0148" xml:id="pb128_0001"/>
<p rendition="#indent-2"><hi rendition="#aq">2</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Marina</hi></hi>. die Seeotter. (Fr. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le castor marin</hi></hi>.<lb/>
