<hi rendition="#aq">Ocelli</hi> 3. <hi rendition="#aq">Antennae thorace longiores.<lb/>
Cauda maris chelata</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Communis</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">P. alis aequalibus nigro<lb/>
maculatis.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#l2em">Frisch <hi rendition="#aq">P</hi>. IX. <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 14. <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 1.</p>
