<p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Lingulata.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Th. corpore oblongo, depresso,<lb/>
antice in apicem acutum desinente.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Abbild. n. h. Gegenst. tab.</hi></hi> 30.</p>  <p rendition="#l1em">Im atlantischen Ocean. Der seel. <hi rendition="#aq">Dr</hi>. Förster,<lb/>
